.SH NAME
SystemEx.Device.NativeRAMKernel< TD > \- Provides a base implementation for RAM‑based compute kernels that operate on \fBDeviceSharedBuffer<RamSharedBackend>\fP instances\&. 
.br
 This class handles module loading, buffer management, backend initialization, locking/unlocking of shared buffers, and asynchronous kernel execution\&. 
.br
 Derived classes only need to implement backend‑specific behavior such as buffer creation (\fBOnCreate\fP) and kernel invocation (\fBOnRun\fP)\&.  

