.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a base implementation for RAM‑based compute kernels that operate on \fBDeviceSharedBuffer<RamSharedBackend>\fP instances\&. 
.br
 This class handles module loading, buffer management, backend initialization, locking/unlocking of shared buffers, and asynchronous kernel execution\&. 
.br
 Derived classes only need to implement backend‑specific behavior such as buffer creation (\fBOnCreate\fP) and kernel invocation (\fBOnRun\fP)\&. 


.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fITD\fP The delegate type representing the native kernel function signature\&. 
.br
 Must be a Delegate compatible with the loaded module\&. 
.RE
.PP

